				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:uthwv2jcpcccf4ec2bzsavg7/bafkreia3pmnk72btquz6ufuupstzrg7tb23smpinwmfntnk7lfl2gj7xae"
			},
			"date": "2026-01-08T21:41:10.914Z",
			"content": "<p>Yeah to be clear I don't either, but I also don't feel as much sympathy.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:j65yyxd3csvlqf7mhjm32mk2/app.bsky.feed.post/3mbwxe5vufc2b",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:uthwv2jcpcccf4ec2bzsavg7/app.bsky.feed.post/3mbwx4aiyyk27",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/naugtur.pl/post/3mbwxe5vufc2b",
			"author": {
				"name": "naugtur",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/naugtur.pl",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:j65yyxd3csvlqf7mhjm32mk2/bafkreifgjypcvlh4tja3w45yv5rce57maucln5gj324tmfcdlv2xnunace"
			},
			"date": "2026-01-08T21:45:36.626Z",
			"content": "<p>My point is - I kinda do feel sympathy. It's a fellow human hurting from the hand of an intelligence I have little in common with (regardless of whether we consider the AI or the billionaire the perpetrator of said hurting)</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:f5vv2f7a4huhkcqy6b4fp5ge/app.bsky.feed.post/3mbx2ncswfs2d",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3mbwvakqt5k24",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/notwes.bsky.social/post/3mbx2ncswfs2d",
			"author": {
				"name": "Wes",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/notwes.bsky.social",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:f5vv2f7a4huhkcqy6b4fp5ge/bafkreiebj773g2oa6omrxl5awgjk2yuegy4c6dwy3725lig5aok7rkib7y"
			},
			"date": "2026-01-08T22:44:24.988Z",
			"content": "<p>I think I agree with you. The whole mess *SUCKS*; I absolutely feel for everyone involved, and hope all the folks impacted are alright. But...this is not simply an \"oss funding issue\". Building a company around services and support for a company owned OSS product is an entirely different problem.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:4v3uz6xgigawvz64fede7ly7/app.bsky.feed.post/3mbx3rqaprk2k",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:j65yyxd3csvlqf7mhjm32mk2/app.bsky.feed.post/3mbwutoi64c2b",
