				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:j65yyxd3csvlqf7mhjm32mk2/bafkreifgjypcvlh4tja3w45yv5rce57maucln5gj324tmfcdlv2xnunace"
			},
			"date": "2026-01-09T07:00:36.686Z",
			"content": "<p>You are a perfectly balanced person.<br>\nYour take on this on the other hand - was a little on the spicy side 😅</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:rsryvlirqu24drkfxklklpcs/app.bsky.feed.post/3mbxwxtu2ec22",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/roomman.bsky.social/post/3mbxwxtu2ec22",
			"author": {
				"name": "Simon Zimmerman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/roomman.bsky.social",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:rsryvlirqu24drkfxklklpcs/bafkreihvbdsd4teqddmji4r3eqz4pjzaxgd4cz44g4gk6tahfoecacqb6q"
			},
			"date": "2026-01-09T07:11:23.166Z",
			"content": "<p>What if the layoffs are a strategic choice? A way of reducing costs in response to external forces? I don’t think it’s right to say all layoffs are a leadership failure.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:cqvd6j3awukvnydbfxiq5hsq/app.bsky.feed.post/3mbyi4tmd4s2g",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3mbwvakqt5k24",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/samalrasmussen.bsky.social/post/3mbyi4tmd4s2g",
			"author": {
				"name": "Sámal Rasmussen ",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/samalrasmussen.bsky.social",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:cqvd6j3awukvnydbfxiq5hsq/bafkreicwsmtmmu5vuoi57py7tsvyntncdcsq7wb6l5gal6ow3fsmfrogyq"
			},
			"date": "2026-01-09T12:18:24.296Z",
			"content": "<p>I still don't understand in what way you mean that the Tailwind leadership failed in this case. Are you suggesting you know that they should have known to do something differently? In that case what?</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:wgxvhnxxxi4jamweu2ldlwkz/app.bsky.feed.post/3mbyqb2dy6k2b",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/thebiglebluesky.bsky.social/post/3mbyqb2dy6k2b",
			"author": {
				"name": "Hugh Spanner",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/thebiglebluesky.bsky.social",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:wgxvhnxxxi4jamweu2ldlwkz/bafkreih7osrzjwapxbpiklt2fodelvaejyewu7eqddyanj7bt27g6d7fmq"
			},
			"date": "2026-01-09T14:43:55.514Z",
			"content": "<p>Not always true, e.g. when you are extracting a finite good.  BP would have done better if it had carried on extracting oil until uneconomical, than trying to pivot to green tech. Also true that automation is a good reason for reducing workforce.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3mbys66mqs22s",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:rsryvlirqu24drkfxklklpcs/app.bsky.feed.post/3mbxwxtu2ec22",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3mbys66mqs22s",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2026-01-09T15:18:06.817Z",
			"content": "<p>in your mind, what is the venn diagram of “strategic choice” and “leadership failure?”</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:rsryvlirqu24drkfxklklpcs/app.bsky.feed.post/3mbyy6jkxus2u",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3mbys66mqs22s",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/roomman.bsky.social/post/3mbyy6jkxus2u",
			"author": {
				"name": "Simon Zimmerman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/roomman.bsky.social",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:rsryvlirqu24drkfxklklpcs/bafkreihvbdsd4teqddmji4r3eqz4pjzaxgd4cz44g4gk6tahfoecacqb6q"
			},
			"date": "2026-01-09T17:05:40.744Z",
			"content": "<p>While most probably are, I’m suggesting that not all layoffs are leadership failures. I suspect M&amp;A would provide good examples of when layoffs are an inevitable, strategic outcome.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
